Description: VeltOS Office: LibreOffice set up for Windows users
 Installs LibreOffice's word processor, spreadsheet and presentation
 programs with the Plasma (Qt) integration and sets them up the way
 people who come from Windows expect: the ribbon-like "Tabbed" interface,
 the Colibre icons, .docx/.xlsx/.pptx as the default file formats without
 a question on every save, fonts with the same metrics as the common
 Windows fonts, and no donation or release-notes bars. Users' own
 settings in LibreOffice take precedence.
